  "translation": "A ye ⟨את⟩ sumaya min cogoya-dilan a ye o bila Elohim so kɔnɔ — min kɔnɔ Elohim ye Dawid (Dawuda) ni a denkɛ Shelomo (Sulɛyɛman) ma ko: So in kɔnɔ ani Yerushalayim (Jerusalɛmu) kɔnɔ, minnu n bɔra Isirayeli maraw bɛɛ la, n bɛna ⟨את⟩ n tɔgɔ bila sɔngɔ-yɔrɔ o ye — dunun kɔrɔbɛ na, dunun bɛɛ la.",
